WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.747
Welcome to Pure Clinics, the skin clinic in Nijmegen and Uden.

00:00:05.067 --> 00:00:08.783
In a few minutes you will see the redesigned app for your clients,

00:00:08.783 --> 00:00:10.866
and the admin panel, now fully in 3D.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:17.319
Opening the app starts with a short entrance, like the opening of a film.

00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:22.293
Then the home screen takes on the light of the day,

00:00:22.293 --> 00:00:24.963
with your next appointment on a pane of glass.

00:00:25.283 --> 00:00:30.437
As you scroll, the photo lags gently behind, and everything glides softly into view.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:36.758
Your laser series shows as a ring: two of the eight done, and the third is ready.

00:00:37.078 --> 00:00:41.181
The app suggests a slot for it right away, with the same skin therapist.

00:00:42.233 --> 00:00:46.962
Popular treatments slide by like cards; the one in the middle comes forward.

00:00:47.282 --> 00:00:51.597
Below, your skin concerns form a photo mosaic, like a magazine page.

00:00:52.633 --> 00:00:56.731
Under Before and after you flick through real results from Pure Clinics,

00:00:56.731 --> 00:00:58.039
like a stack of photos.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:01.803
The tab bar floats at the bottom, like glass.

00:01:01.803 --> 00:01:04.205
Tap Book, and a light lens glides along.

00:01:04.525 --> 00:01:07.891
All treatments are laid out here as a mosaic of photos.

00:01:08.933 --> 00:01:12.860
Tap a treatment, and its photo grows into the page itself.

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:19.195
The details slide over it like a sheet: how it works, how often, recovery and price.

00:01:20.233 --> 00:01:24.681
Then booking. The switch between Nijmegen and Uden slides along with your choice.

00:01:25.001 --> 00:01:27.461
Choose a day and a time, and confirm.

00:01:29.667 --> 00:01:34.052
Your appointment arrives as a pass, with a code to check in at the front desk.

00:01:35.133 --> 00:01:39.251
Not sure what suits you? The skin advice asks four short questions.

00:01:41.653 --> 00:01:45.331
Then it scans your skin, on a sample photo in this demo,

00:01:45.331 --> 00:01:47.564
and you see a score for each part.

00:01:48.373 --> 00:01:53.177
It always ends with a free intake, where a skin therapist takes a look with you.

00:01:54.233 --> 00:01:57.492
The shop shows the aftercare that suits your treatment.

00:01:57.492 --> 00:01:59.447
One tap and it is in your basket.

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:03.687
My Pure holds your appointments, your laser series,

00:02:03.687 --> 00:02:06.686
and your membership, like a card in your wallet.

00:02:07.733 --> 00:02:12.014
And on a computer everything works as an ordinary website, in six languages.

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:16.670
Then the admin panel, for the team.

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:20.622
Today's numbers count up, and both clinics appear in 3D.

00:02:20.942 --> 00:02:24.348
In every room stands the specialist working there today.

00:02:24.348 --> 00:02:28.545
If someone is in the green chair, a treatment is under way right now.

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:32.733
Click a client, and the camera flies into the room.

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:37.503
There the client card opens: the treatment now, the next appointment,

00:02:37.503 --> 00:02:40.488
and earlier visits with the specialist's notes.

00:02:40.808 --> 00:02:42.586
Press Escape to fly back.

00:02:44.467 --> 00:02:45.800
Everything runs live.

00:02:45.800 --> 00:02:49.863
When someone pays, a coin flies from the room to the front desk.

00:02:50.187 --> 00:02:52.530
And on the right, everything that just happened comes in.

00:02:53.833 --> 00:02:57.211
On the way you pass the diary per room, and the treatment plans.

00:02:57.553 --> 00:03:00.092
The webshop stands there as a small shop.

00:03:00.092 --> 00:03:03.931
When an order comes in, the products leave the shelf in a box.

00:03:04.967 --> 00:03:09.125
The week's revenue stands in columns, per day and per clinic.

00:03:09.125 --> 00:03:11.374
Today's grows with every payment.

00:03:12.433 --> 00:03:15.892
Want to see a whole day at once? Press Play the day.

00:03:16.353 --> 00:03:20.032
The rooms fill up and empty again, and revenue grows,

00:03:20.032 --> 00:03:22.946
from seven in the morning to ten at night.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:29.754
That was Pure Clinics: one app for your clients, and one overview for your team.

00:03:29.754 --> 00:03:30.186
Enjoy!
